## INTEGRATION PATTERNS

### 1. GameHUD ↔ SpellManager Communication
```gdscript
# GameHUD connects to SpellManager signals:
spell_manager.spell_cooldown_started.connect(_on_spell_cooldown_started)
spell_manager.spell_cooldown_finished.connect(_on_spell_cooldown_finished)
spell_manager.spell_loadout_initialized.connect(_on_spell_loadout_updated)

# SpellManager updates GameHUD via signals:
spell_cooldown_started.emit(spell_index, cooldown_duration)
spell_loadout_initialized.emit(spell_loadout)
```

### 2. Player Input Flow
```
User Input (Key 1-5, 6-0) → 
GameHUD._input() → 
GameHUD.cast_spell_from_slot() → 
SpellManager.attempt_cast_spell_robust() → 
Combat execution + UI feedback
```

### 3. Cooldown Management
```
SpellManager starts cooldown →
Signal emitted to GameHUD →
GameHUD visual overlay activated →
Real-time countdown display →
Cooldown completion signal →
Visual overlay hidden
```

